 {title:pair('訓練後的小休','A break after training'),text:pair('訓練員安排兩種活動：練習與夥伴同步，或協助整理訓練用品。','Your trainer offers two activities: practise matching your partner’s pace, or help tidy the training equipment.'),options:[{label:pair('練習控制步伐','Practise pacing'),detail:pair('獲 2 張步伐券；不加骨頭。','Receive 2 pace tickets; no bones.'),pace:2},{label:pair('協助收拾訓練用品','Help tidy the training kit'),detail:pair('獲 2 骨頭；不加道具。','Receive 2 bones; no items.'),delta:2}]}
